andalone · PLACEHOLDER","w":1440,"x":10220,"y":0},"Video-Popup-Mobile.dc.html":{"h":1060,"page":"founders","title":"1.1VM · Video popup · playing · mobile · 9:16, no frame, captions","w":390,"x":3590,"y":1300},"Video-Popup-Reveal-Mobile.dc.html":{"h":1060,"page":"founders","title":"1.1V2M · Video popup · reveal · mobile","w":390,"x":3590,"y":2380},"Video-Popup-Reveal.dc.html":{"h":940,"page":"founders","title":"1.1V2 · Video popup · reveal · button closes and jumps to Nº 001","w":1440,"x":2070,"y":2380},"Video-Popup.dc.html":{"h":940,"is_interactive":true,"page":"founders","title":"1.1V · Video popup · playing · one-line captions (click the progress bar to preview the reveal)","w":1440,"x":2070,"y":1300},"Champion-Team-Seats.dc.html":{"expand":"fill","x":0,"y":18000,"w":1440,"h":6951,"page":"champion","title":"2.8 · Bring your team · Team Seats for Champions · /[SLUG TBD] · cart: secure.darrenhardy.com/checkout/founders-event-team"},"Champion-Team-Seats-Mobile.dc.html":{"x":1520,"y":18000,"w":390,"h":6786,"page":"champion","title":"2.8 M"}},"createdOnFiles":{"at":"2026-11-08T03:40:00Z","v":1},"designSystems":[{"artifact":"https://claude.ai/artifact/5ZD4pMoKnRuDgEwn3QLTFn","copiedAt":"2026-11-08T03:40:00Z","namespace":"tceb","title":"TCEB Design SYSTEM","version":"1793955694-e5dd"}],"launch":{"page":"founders","view":"canvas"},"noteOrder":["rowpages","rowchamp","rowref","refnote","signednote","rowspiffy","spiffysrc","archnote","brollnote","navgate1108","nc1109"],"notes":{"archnote":{"kind":"title1","maxW":1440,"page":"founders","text":"ARCHIVE · earlier 1.1 page (v1) + saved sections (Nov 8)","w":1440,"x":13460,"y":-320},"brollnote":{"fill":"blue","page":"founders","text":"Stage b-roll: its own section, \"Declarations over stage b-roll\", under the hero on 1.1.\n\nVimeo: https://player.vimeo.com/video/1198744115\n\nOn the board it plays as an uploaded 18-second muted loop (WebM). The live page can embed the Vimeo player as a muted background instead.","w":380,"x":-460,"y":0},"navgate1108":{"fill":"blue","page":"founders","text":"Nav bar (1.1): hidden when the page loads. It slides in and stays sticky once the hero's Reserve my FOUNDERS seat button scrolls past, and hides again back at the top. Live on staging 11/09.","w":380,"x":-460,"y":420},"nc1109":{"fill":"blue","page":"founders","text":"NEW COPY proposal (11/09), written to DH's notes and comments: seduction over explanation, identity, going first, the edge, teams elevated, Darren in third person. Same design as the live page; only the copy changes, plus the 1967 ticket removed and THE COLLECTIVE logo inline. Not built in Webflow. Full copy doc: Founders Event 1.1 · New Copy.","w":420,"x":-4070,"y":-420},"refnote":{"fill":"gray","page":"champion","text":"Champion’s link: card.darrenhardy.com/champion-invitation/[REF ID]. The Champion page code also names thecompoundeffect.com/champion-invitation as this page’s URL.\n\n[NAME] is the referring Champion’s first name, carried through from the link.\n\nFlow: 2.3 landing → Reserve my Founders seat (Spiffy 3.2) → 2.4 GA or 2.5 VIP. Or → free book form → 2.6 (US hardcover) or 2.7 (digital).\n\n2.3a is clickable in Play: play the video, then try both buttons and the US/digital swap. 2.3b–e are the same page parked on each state.\n\nStill placeholders: video poster, SUCCESS covers wall, DarrenDaily photo and logo, the phone-only audiobook image.","w":360,"x":18630,"y":11669},"rowchamp":{"kind":"title1","maxW":3980,"page":"champion","text":"The Champion Board · signed out / signed in · desktop + mobile","w":240,"x":0,"y":-320},"rowpages":{"kind":"title1","maxW":8000,"page":"founders","text":"Founders Event · the website pages","w":240,"x":0,"y":-2680},"rowref":{"kind":"title1","maxW":8000,"page":"champion","text":"TCE Invite · referral funnel · what a leader sees from a Champion’s link · every state, desktop + mobile","w":240,"x":0,"y":11349},"rowspiffy":{"kind":"title1","maxW":7650,"page":"spiffy","text":"Spiffy Forms · checkout forms for each page · desktop + mobile","w":240,"x":0,"y":-320},"signednote":{"fill":"blue","page":"champion","text":"Signed-in pieces sit level with the part of 2.1 they replace or join: 2.2a under the hero, 2.2b at Your next move, 2.2c at the FAQ. Everything else on the page is the same signed in or out.","w":420,"x":2070,"y":0},"spiffysrc":{"fill":"gray","page":"spiffy","text":"3.1 · Main Sales page (1.1): VIP bump + Team Seats bump. Live URL [TBD].\n\n3.2 · Referral funnel, no team: secure.darrenhardy.com/checkout/the-compound-effect-in-business-founders-event-referrals-evergreen\n\n3.3 · Founding Team Seats, Pay Monthly (layout from the Hardy Harvest team seats form): secure.darrenhardy.com/checkout/hardy-harvest-team-seats\nThe Hardy Harvest gift set line and shipping checkbox are kept from that promo; swap them for the Founders Event versions.\n\nEach M board is the same form at phone width (390px).","w":360,"x":7730,"y":0},"rowteam":{"kind":"title1","maxW":1910,"page":"champion","text":"Bring your team · Team Seats for Champions · desktop + mobile","w":240,"x":0,"y":17680},"teamnote":{"fill":"gray","page":"champion","w":380,"x":1990,"y":18000,"text":"Linked from the Champion Board \"Enroll · Team Seat\" card. Every button goes to secure.darrenhardy.com/checkout/founders-event-team.\n\nCopy sources: DH's Founders Event Context File (Bring your team: who to bring, why bring your team), Sales Page Architecture v2 section 11 (\"They've heard you. They haven't heard me.\"), the rant script (\"nothing to sell on Monday\").\n\nPrice: $308/mo leads, $3,995 one payment, paid in full. Each Team Seat = 1 Impact Point. In-Studio award left out on purpose.\n\nOpen: slug, Webflow build."}},"order":["Story-Side-Frame-Mobile.dc.html","Story-Side-Frame.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC-Mobile-3.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC-Mobile-2.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC-Mobile.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC-4.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC-3.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC-2.dc.html","Main-Flow-NC.dc.html","Page-System.dc.html","Exit-